      <activity id="28351ed0-abe9-57e4-b3ed-611ef1e4272f" activityNameId="b60e289c-17cd-5c23-a8d1-822d0b6c0216" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Wood pellets, u=10%, at storehouse</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Wood pellets, u=10%, at storehouse
The volume refers to the bulked volume: dried matter content = 650 kg/m3, lower heating value = 12'164 MJ/m3. Various technologies for pellet production are available. The ratio of beech and spruce refelcts current consumtion of the species;
UUID: cfc71d06-a527-3c6f-b81b-091fe5aa6892
Contains the pressing of pellets out of dried industrial residual wood from planing mill (u=10%). Transports of the input material is not considered because pellet mill and planing mill are on the same site.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Average production in Austria 1996
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Austria is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_cfc71d06-a527-3c6f-b81b-091fe5aa6892.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
